 the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"title":"Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onDrop(of:delegate:)-53cte":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/ondrop(of:delegate:)-53cte","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onDrop(of:delegate:)-53cte","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onDrop"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:22UniformTypeIdentifiers6UTTypeV","text":"UTType"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"delegate"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI12DropDelegateP","text":"DropDelegate"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":